@startuml Fluxo de Saque
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
'  Fluxo de Saque via PIX
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam SequenceMessageAlignment center

skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor #FAFAFA
  BorderColor #BDBDBD
  FontStyle bold
}

skinparam sequence {
  ArrowThickness 1.5
  ArrowColor #555555
  LifeLineBorderColor #CCCCCC
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #F5F5F5
  GroupBorderColor #F57C00
  GroupBackgroundColor #FFF3E0
  DividerBorderColor #CCCCCC
}

title **Fluxo de Saque via PIX**

actor "👤 Dono da\nCausa" as U
participant "⚡ API" as API #E3F2FD
database "🐘 PostgreSQL" as DB #E8EAF6

== Solicitação de saque ==

U -> API : POST /withdrawals\n{ causeId, amount, pixKey }
activate API

API -> DB : Busca Cause
activate DB
DB --> API : cause
deactivate DB

note right of API
  Validações:
  ✓ Usuário é o dono da causa?
  ✓ Saldo >= valor solicitado?
end note

group Operação atômica
  API -> DB : Decrementa cause.balance\n(reserva saldo)
  API -> DB : Cria Withdrawal\n(status: PENDING)
end

API --> U : { id, status: PENDING,\n  amount, pixKey }
deactivate API

@enduml
